  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento de la Direccin Nacional de Servicio Civil</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the National Civil Service Department</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program&apos;s objective is to deepen the modernization and professionalization of public human resource management in Chile, by strengthening the institutional capacity of the National Civil Service Department (DNSC).
The program will finance activities in three components: (i) Institutional capacity building in the DNSC, (ii) Support to the implementation of the Senior Executive Service, and (iii) Support to the modernization of human resource management in the Chilean Civil Service at the Central Government. With these three components, the project will support three complementary areas: the internal capacities of the DNSC, the effective implementation of the new legislation regarding the senior executive service and the proffesionalization of human resource management in the Central Government</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
